> >
> > The timeout value of __xe_wait_ufence returns the
> > remaining time, not elapsed time. Fix it.
> >
> > Signed-off-by: Oak Zeng <oak.zeng@intel.com>
> > ---
> >  lib/xe/xe_ioctl.c | 2 +-
